         MACRO                                                          01000038
         IHADVCT2 ,                                                     01100038
*********************************************************************** 01200038
*        MODULO DASD DEVICE CHARACTERISTICS TABLE                     * 01300038
*********************************************************************** 01400038
*                                                                       01500038
*         These DSECTs are part of the mvs3380 usermod, which           01600038
*         provides (at least some) support for 3380s and 3390s.         01700038
*                                                                       01800038
*         Although MVS38j did have some support for 3380s,              01900038
*         it never (to my knowledge) had any support for 3390s.         02000038
*                                                                       02100038
*         These DSECTs represents the subset of devices mapped          02200038
*         by IHADVCT which are "modulo" devices, specifically           02300038
*         the 3380 and 3390 devices.  For non-modulo devices,           02400038
*         refer to the IHADVCT macro (2314, 3330, 3350, etc.).          02500038
*                                                                       02600038
*         The first DSECT, DVCTI, represents the index located          02700038
*         at the front of the IECZDTAB CSECT (assembled as part         02800038
*         of Stage2 of an MVS38j sysgen).                               02900038
*                                                                       03000038
*         The second DSECT, DVCT, represents an entry located           03100038
*         via the index in DVCTI.  The entry is also located            03200038
*         in the IECZDTAB CSECT.                                        03300038
*                                                                       03400038
*         The CVT contains a field, CVTZDTAB, which points              03500038
*         to the IECZDTAB CSECT.  IECZDTAB consists of the              03600038
*         index, followed immediately by the DVCT entries.              03700038
*         Only DVCT entries for dasd devices which have been            03800038
*         generated appear in IECZDTAB.                                 03900038
*                                                                       04000038
*         To locate an entry in IECZDTAB:                               04100038
*                                                                       04200038
*         1) Extract the device code field UCBTBYT4,                    04300038
*            from the UCB representing the dasd device.                 04400038
*                                                                       04500038
*               DASD device codes (in hex):                             04600038
*                  01  2311   06  2305-1   0B  3350                     04700038
*                  02  2301   07  2305-2   0C  3375                     04800038
*                  03  2303   08  2314     0D  3330-11                  04900038
*                  04  2302   09  3330     0E  3380                     05000038
*                  05  2321   0A  3340     0F  3390                     05100038
*               I've also seen some higher values (maybe in MVT)        05200038
*               which I think were related to MSS.                      05300038
*                                                                       05400038
*         2) Add CVTZDTAB + (low order 4 bits of) the device code.      05500038
*            This is the address of the DVCTIOFF byte (below).          05600038
*                                                                       05700038
*         3) Add CVTZDTAB + DVCTIOFF, which points at the               05800038
*            related DVCT entry.                                        05900038
*                                                                       06000038
*********************************************************************** 06100038
*  Index into DVCT                                                      06200038
*********************************************************************** 06300038
DVCTI    DSECT ,                                                        06400038
DVCTIOFF DS    XL1                offset to DVCT entry, relative        06500038
*                                 to IECZDTAB base address              06600038
*                                 The 0th entry is a flag               06700038
*********************************************************************** 06800038
*  DVCT entry for 3380s and 3390s                                       06900038
*********************************************************************** 07000038
DVCT     DSECT ,                                                        07100038
DVCCYL   DS    H        # cylinders per volume (including alternates)   07200038
DVCTRK   DS    H        # tracks per cylinder                           07300038
DVCTRKLN DS    XL2      # bytes per track (unsigned)                    07400038
*                       (excluding space for IBM standard Record0,      07500038
*                       which is assumed to be present)                 07600038
DVCOVH1  DS    H        modulo overhead value 1                         07700038
DVCOVNK  DS    XL1      non-keyed overhead decrement                    07800038
DVCFLAGS DS    B        Flags:                                          07900038
DVCMODU  EQU   16          modulo device                                08000038
DVCOVH2  DS    H        modulo overhead value 2                         08100038
DVCALT   DS    H        # alternate tracks per volume                   08200038
DVCENTLG EQU   *-DVCT   length of basic DVCT (excluding RPS + mods)     08300038
*                                                                       08400038
DVCRPS   DS    0XL4     RPS section (present when UCBTBYT2.UCBRPS=1)    08500038
DVCOVR0  DS    H        Record0 overhead bytes                          08600038
DVCSECT  DS    XL1      # sectors in full track                         08700038
DVCSECTD EQU   *,1      # data sectors = DVCTRKLN / DVCBPSEC            08800038
DVCDSECT DS    XL1      # data sectors                                  08900038
*                                                                       09000038
DVCBPSEC DS    XL2      # bytes per sector                              09100038
*                                                                       09200038
DVCMOD1  DS    XL2      modulo factor                                   09300038
*---------------------------------------------------------------------- 09400038
DVCSPAR1 DS    XL2      usermod: spare/alignment; zero                  09500038
DVCUFIX1 DS    A        usermod: V(UTRKCALC)                            09600038
         MEND                                                           09700038
